WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:04,540
This is really well embroidered. My cousin took the trouble to do it.

2
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:07,740
I also prepared some greeting gifts, all of which are familiarity

3
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:10,940
If it's not easy to bring it over, I'll have it delivered directly to your yard.

4
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:13,940
Okay, okay, the second sister-in-law has also finished introducing them one by one.

5
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:15,940
Let’s continue the rest another day.

6
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:18,940
Sister-in-law, I'm hungry. Come to Shanting for a meal.

7
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:25,030
By the way, my mother sent a letter two days ago.

8
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:28,830
Counting the days, I guess we will arrive in Chang'an soon.

9
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:42,140
Thank you husband
